note Nominal operator operands: xor of two constructor calls evaluates the left operand first. The trace
note global records the order in decimal digits (left 1, right 2): 12. Exit is the trace.
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops xor
holds dup32 dup32
global tr ulong 1
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn left to dup32
put tr 0 add mul get tr 0 10 1
ret dup32mk 3
end
fn right to dup32
put tr 0 add mul get tr 0 10 2
ret dup32mk 5
end
fn main to int
v = xor left right
if ne open v 0x0000000600000006
ret 1
end
ret int get tr 0
end
